#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:2
msgid "Math operations"
msgstr "數學運算"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:4
msgid ""
"Python works as a calculator out of the box. This page covers the operators "
"you will use most often: arithmetic on numbers, comparisons that produce "
"booleans, logical operators that combine conditions, and bitwise operators "
"for hardware-level work."
msgstr ""
"Python "
"開箱即可當作計算機使用。本頁涵蓋你最常用到的運算子：數字的算術運算、產生布林值的比較運算、組合條件的邏輯運算子，以及用於硬體層級工作的位元運算子。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:10
msgid "Arithmetic"
msgstr "算術運算"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:12
msgid ""
"The standard arithmetic operators on :class:`int` and :class:`float` values:"
msgstr "作用於 :class:`int` 與 :class:`float` 值的標準算術運算子："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:15
msgid "``+`` -- addition"
msgstr "``+`` -- 加法"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:16
msgid "``-`` -- subtraction (or negation, as a prefix: ``-x``)"
msgstr "``-`` -- 減法（或作為前綴時表示取負：\\ ``-x``\\ ）"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:17
msgid "``*`` -- multiplication"
msgstr "``*`` -- 乘法"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:18
msgid ""
"``/`` -- division. **Always** returns a :class:`float`, even when both "
"operands are integers."
msgstr "``/`` -- 除法。\\ **永遠** 回傳 :class:`float`\\ ，即使兩個運算元都是整數也一樣。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:20
msgid ""
"``//`` -- floor division. Returns the integer quotient rounded toward minus-"
"infinity."
msgstr "``//`` -- 向下取整除法。回傳向負無窮大取整的整數商。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:22
msgid "``%`` -- modulo (remainder)."
msgstr "``%`` -- 取模（餘數）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:23
msgid "``**`` -- exponentiation (``2 ** 10`` is 1024)."
msgstr "``**`` -- 次方（\\ ``2 ** 10`` 等於 1024）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:38
msgid "Mixed-type arithmetic promotes integers to floats automatically:"
msgstr "混合型別的算術運算會自動將整數提升為浮點數："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:45
msgid ""
"Augmented assignment combines the operator with ``=`` for a compact in-place"
" update:"
msgstr "增量指派將運算子與 ``=`` 結合，以進行精簡的就地更新："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:54
msgid ""
"Operator precedence follows the conventional order: ``**`` first, then unary"
" ``-``, then ``*``, ``/``, ``//``, and ``%``, then ``+`` and ``-``. Use "
"parentheses when you are unsure -- they cost nothing at runtime."
msgstr ""
"運算子優先順序遵循慣例次序：先是 ``**``\\ ，接著是一元 ``-``\\ ，然後是 ``*``\\ 、\\ ``/``\\ 、\\ ``//``"
" 與 ``%``\\ ，最後是 ``+`` 與 ``-``\\ 。不確定時就使用括號 -- 它們在執行時不會帶來任何成本。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:60
msgid "Comparison"
msgstr "比較運算"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:62
msgid "Comparison operators return a :class:`bool` (``True`` or ``False``):"
msgstr "比較運算子回傳 :class:`bool`\\ （\\ ``True`` 或 ``False``\\ ）："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:64
msgid "``==`` and ``!=`` -- equal / not equal."
msgstr "``==`` 與 ``!=`` -- 等於 / 不等於。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:65
msgid "``<``, ``<=``, ``>``, ``>=`` -- ordering."
msgstr "``<``\\ 、\\ ``<=``\\ 、\\ ``>``\\ 、\\ ``>=`` -- 排序。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:76
msgid ""
"The last example is a *chained* comparison and is exactly equivalent to ``3 "
"< 5 and 5 <= 5``."
msgstr "最後一個範例是 *連鎖* 比較，完全等同於 ``3 < 5 and 5 <= 5``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:81
msgid ""
"``=`` assigns; ``==`` compares. The expression ``if x = 5:`` is a syntax "
"error precisely because Python refuses to silently confuse the two."
msgstr ""
"``=`` 用於指派；\\ ``==`` 用於比較。\\ ``if x = 5:`` 這個運算式正是語法錯誤，因為 Python 拒絕悄悄地混淆這兩者。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:86
msgid "Boolean logic"
msgstr "布林邏輯"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:88
msgid "Three operators combine booleans:"
msgstr "三個運算子可組合布林值："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:90
msgid "``and`` -- ``True`` only when both sides are true."
msgstr "``and`` -- 只有當兩邊都為真時才是 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:91
msgid "``or`` -- ``True`` when either side is true."
msgstr "``or`` -- 當任一邊為真時即為 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:92
msgid "``not`` -- inverts a single boolean."
msgstr "``not`` -- 反轉單一布林值。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:94
msgid ""
"``and`` and ``or`` *short-circuit*: they stop evaluating as soon as the "
"result is known. ``False and slow_check()`` never calls ``slow_check``."
msgstr ""
"``and`` 與 ``or`` 會 *短路求值*\\ ：一旦結果已知就停止求值。\\ ``False and slow_check()`` "
"永遠不會呼叫 ``slow_check``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:98
msgid ""
"``and`` and ``or`` also return one of their operands rather than a literal "
"``True`` or ``False``, which lets you write defaults compactly:"
msgstr ""
"``and`` 與 ``or`` 也會回傳其中一個運算元，而非字面的 ``True`` 或 ``False``\\ ，這讓你能精簡地撰寫預設值："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:107
msgid "Bitwise operators"
msgstr "位元運算子"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:109
msgid ""
"For hardware work -- packing register fields, masking bits, parsing protocol"
" headers -- you will reach for the bitwise operators. They act on the binary"
" representation of an :class:`int`:"
msgstr ""
"進行硬體工作時 -- 打包暫存器欄位、遮罩位元、解析協定標頭 -- 你會用到位元運算子。它們作用於 :class:`int` 的二進位表示："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:114
msgid "``&`` -- bitwise AND"
msgstr "``&`` -- 位元 AND"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:115
msgid "``|`` -- bitwise OR"
msgstr "``|`` -- 位元 OR"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:116
msgid "``^`` -- bitwise XOR"
msgstr "``^`` -- 位元 XOR"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:117
msgid "``~`` -- bitwise NOT (one's complement)"
msgstr "``~`` -- 位元 NOT（一補數）"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:118
msgid "``<<`` -- left shift"
msgstr "``<<`` -- 左移"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:119
msgid "``>>`` -- right shift"
msgstr "``>>`` -- 右移"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:121
msgid ""
"The hex and binary literal forms are convenient when reading and writing "
"these:"
msgstr "讀寫這些值時，十六進位與二進位的字面形式很方便："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:137
msgid ""
"Augmented forms exist for each: ``|=``, ``&=``, ``^=``, ``<<=``, ``>>=``."
msgstr "每個運算子都有對應的增量形式：\\ ``|=``\\ 、\\ ``&=``\\ 、\\ ``^=``\\ 、\\ ``<<=``\\ 、\\ ``>>=``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:142
msgid ""
"``and`` / ``or`` operate on booleans (or on truthiness); ``&`` / ``|`` "
"operate on bits. Do not mix them up. ``0b1100 and 0b1010`` evaluates to "
"``0b1010`` because both operands are truthy -- not what you usually want "
"when manipulating bits."
msgstr ""
"``and`` / ``or`` 作用於布林值（或真假性）；\\ ``&`` / ``|`` 作用於位元。不要把它們搞混。\\ ``0b1100 and"
" 0b1010`` 求值結果為 ``0b1010``\\ ，因為兩個運算元都為真 -- 這通常不是你在操作位元時想要的結果。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:148
msgid "Useful number built-ins"
msgstr "實用的數字內建函式"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:150
msgid ""
"A handful of built-in functions cover common numeric operations that the "
"operators alone do not:"
msgstr "有少數幾個內建函式涵蓋了單靠運算子無法完成的常見數值運算："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:153
msgid ""
":func:`round` -- nearest integer, or nearest ``ndigits`` decimal places when"
" a second argument is given. Returns an :class:`int` for ``round(x)``, a "
":class:`float` for ``round(x, n)``. Ties (``0.5``, ``1.5``, ...) round to "
"the nearest even number, not always up."
msgstr ""
":func:`round` -- 最接近的整數，或在給定第二個引數時取最接近的 ``ndigits`` 小數位數。\\ ``round(x)`` 回傳 "
":class:`int`\\ ，\\ ``round(x, n)`` 回傳 :class:`float`\\ 。位於正中間的值（\\ ``0.5``\\"
" 、\\ ``1.5``\\ 、……）會四捨五入到最接近的偶數，而非總是進位。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:158
msgid ""
":func:`divmod` -- returns ``(quotient, remainder)`` in one call. Handy for "
"splitting one quantity into units (seconds into minutes-and-seconds, bytes "
"into pages-and-offsets)."
msgstr ""
":func:`divmod` -- 一次呼叫即回傳 ``(quotient, remainder)``\\ "
"。便於將某個量拆分成多個單位（將秒拆成分與秒、將位元組拆成頁與偏移量）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:161
msgid ""
":func:`pow` -- the same as ``**`` in the two-argument form. The three-"
"argument form ``pow(base, exp, mod)`` computes ``(base ** exp) % mod`` "
"without ever materialising the giant intermediate value, which is the only "
"practical way to do modular exponentiation for large exponents."
msgstr ""
":func:`pow` -- 雙引數形式與 ``**`` 相同。三引數形式 ``pow(base, exp, mod)`` 會計算 ``(base **"
" exp) % mod``\\ ，且過程中絕不會具體產生龐大的中間值，這是針對大指數進行模冪運算唯一可行的方法。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:187
msgid ""
"Integer-to-string base conversions (``bin``, ``oct``, ``hex``) are covered "
"in :doc:`String methods and formatting <../text/formatting>`."
msgstr ""
"整數轉字串的進位制轉換（\\ ``bin``\\ 、\\ ``oct``\\ 、\\ ``hex``\\ ）涵蓋於 :doc:`字串方法與格式化 "
"<../text/formatting>` 中。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:192
msgid "The math module"
msgstr "math 模組"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:194
msgid ""
"Common mathematical functions live in the :mod:`math` module. Import it once"
" and call its functions through a dotted name:"
msgstr "常見的數學函式存在於 :mod:`math` 模組中。匯入它一次，然後透過點號名稱呼叫其函式："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:206
msgid ""
"The MicroPython :mod:`math` module covers the usual suspects (``sqrt``, "
"``exp``, ``log``, ``sin``, ``cos``, ``tan``, ``atan2``, ``floor``, ``ceil``,"
" ``pi``, ``e``, ...). For random numbers, see the :mod:`random` module; for "
"fixed-point bit twiddling, the operators above are usually enough."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython 的 :mod:`math` 模組涵蓋了常見的那些函式（\\ ``sqrt``\\ 、\\ ``exp``\\ 、\\ "
"``log``\\ 、\\ ``sin``\\ 、\\ ``cos``\\ 、\\ ``tan``\\ 、\\ ``atan2``\\ 、\\ "
"``floor``\\ 、\\ ``ceil``\\ 、\\ ``pi``\\ 、\\ ``e``\\ 、……）。需要亂數時，請參閱 "
":mod:`random` 模組；至於定點位元操作，上述運算子通常就足夠了。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:213
msgid "Complex numbers"
msgstr "複數"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/getting-started/math.rst:215
msgid ""
"For numerical work that needs imaginary components, Python has a "
":class:`complex` type with ``j``-suffix literals (``1 + 2j``). The "
":mod:`cmath` module mirrors :mod:`math` for complex inputs. Both are present"
" on most MicroPython builds but rarely needed for camera work; mention them "
"mainly so they aren't a surprise if you port code that uses them."
msgstr ""
"對於需要虛數成分的數值工作，Python 有一個 :class:`complex` 型別，使用 ``j`` 後綴字面值（\\ ``1 + 2j``\\ "
"）。\\ :mod:`cmath` 模組對複數輸入提供了與 :mod:`math` 對應的功能。兩者在大多數 MicroPython "
"建置中都存在，但相機工作鮮少需要用到；在此提及主要是為了讓你在移植使用它們的程式碼時不會感到意外。"
